  "title": "IntentVLA: Short-Horizon Intent Modeling for Aliased Robot Manipulation",
  "summary": "IntentVLA improves rollout stability and outperforms VLA baselines by encoding short-horizon intent representations and addressing aliasing issues through a history-conditioned framework, as demonstrated across AliasBench and RoboTwin2 platforms.",
